flowchart LR
    start([Start validation]) --> env[Validate environment variables]
    env --> deps[Validate Python dependencies]
    deps --> api[Submit document request]
    api --> queue[Verify RabbitMQ queue]
    queue --> worker[Run processing worker]
    worker --> documents[Verify document processing]
    documents --> chunks[Verify Qdrant chunks]
    chunks --> agents[Verify all agents]
    agents --> logs[Verify status and error logs]
    logs --> report[Record validation results]
    report --> finish([Validation complete])
